{"id":"H0244","lemma":"אׇזְנִי","transliteration":"ozni","sayIt":"oz-ni","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ozni","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Gad living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Gen.46.16;\nson of: Gad (H1410);\nbrother of: Ziphion (H6837), Haggi (H2291), Shuni (H7764), Eri (H6179), Arod (H0720) and Areli (H0692); also called Ozni at Num.26.16;\nAnother name of ets.bon (אֶצְבּוֹן \"Ezbon\" H0675G)\n§ Ozni = \"my ear (hearing)\"\nson of Gad","glosses":["oznite"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"num-26","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"the Oznite","kjv":"Of Ozni"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Numbers 26:16","note":"of Ozni, the family of the Oznites; of Eri, the family of the Erites;","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0675","lemma":"אֶצְבּוֹן","transliteration":"etsbon","gloss":"Ezbon"},{"id":"H1410","lemma":"גָּד","transliteration":"gad","gloss":"Gad"},{"id":"H6837","lemma":"צִפְיוֹן","transliteration":"tsiphyon","gloss":"Ziphion"},{"id":"H2291","lemma":"חַגִּי","transliteration":"chaggi","gloss":"Haggi"},{"id":"H7764","lemma":"שׁוּנִי","transliteration":"shuni","gloss":"Shuni"},{"id":"H6179","lemma":"עֵרִי","transliteration":"eri","gloss":"Eri"},{"id":"H0720","lemma":"אֲרוֹד","transliteration":"arod","gloss":"Arod"},{"id":"H0692","lemma":"אַרְאֵלִי","transliteration":"areli","gloss":"Areli"}],"senses":[{"id":"H0244B","gloss":"Oznite","relation":"H0244B = a group of"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}